30,2,1,talk,George,,"It seems that asking for favors or clinging to unused turns is what ruins these things. Also, checking figures creates a lot of tension.","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
31,2,1,talk,Toshio,,"Recording every run is a huge time sink, and those heavy-use weeks cause total chaos in our schedules.","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
32,2,1,talk,Victoria,,"The car is often left dirty or empty. Plus, our weekly repeating trips are the ones that keep getting cancelled.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
33,2,1,talk,Misaki,,"The fixed costs are over 280,000 yen, and the fuel spending is incredibly lopsided. Some of us barely drive, others pay for almost everything.","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
34,2,1,talk,Minato,,"Saturdays are way busier than Tuesdays! Also, the mechanic says our short trips are actually wearing out the brakes and battery faster.","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
35,2,2,talk,George,,"@Misaki, if the fuel is that uneven, that explains some of the tension.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[""Misaki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
36,2,2,talk,Toshio,,"@Victoria, if the weekly trips are collapsing, it's because we're spending too much time coordinating.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[""Victoria""],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,2,2,talk,Victoria,,"@Toshio, exactly. It's not just the coordination, it's the state of the car when I finally get it.","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[""Toshio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,2,2,talk,Misaki,,"@Minato, the usage gap you found in the diary matches the fuel receipts I saw.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[""Minato""],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,2,2,talk,Minato,,It's a bit scary that we didn't know the real numbers before.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,2,3,talk,George,,We need a system that doesn't require us to constantly ask for favors or police each other's spending.,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,2,3,talk,Toshio,,I agree. A system that takes an hour a week just to track is unsustainable.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
42,2,3,talk,Victoria,,I just want to know the car will be there and ready for my weekly needs.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
43,2,3,talk,Misaki,,"We can't keep pretending a ""share is a share"" when the costs are this unbalanced.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
44,2,3,talk,Minato,,I hope we can find a way that makes everyone feel it's fair.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
