55,3,1,talk,George,,"Option A seems too much like the ""checking figures"" nightmare. Option B is cleaner, but Option C removes the favor-asking.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
56,3,1,talk,Toshio,,Option A is a time-sink. Option B is stable. Option C is the most efficient for the organizers.,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
57,3,1,talk,Victoria,,Option B would guarantee my weekly trips. Option A is too unpredictable. Option C depends too much on one person.,"{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
58,3,1,talk,Misaki,,"Option A is the only one that's truly fair for fuel, but Option B is simpler for the fixed costs.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
59,3,1,talk,Minato,,Option A sounds like a lot of work. Option B seems peaceful because everyone has their own day.,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
60,3,2,talk,George,,"@Misaki, is the fairness of Option A worth the risk of us fighting over the numbers again?","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[""Misaki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
61,3,2,talk,Toshio,,"@Victoria, if we go with B, you'd never have to worry about your weekly slot being taken.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[""Victoria""],""raw_differs"":false}"
62,3,2,talk,Victoria,,"@Toshio, that's true. It would solve the handover stress too, mostly.","{""words"":11,""mentions"":[""Toshio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
63,3,2,talk,Misaki,,"@George, you're right. The social cost of tracking every kilometer might be too high.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[""George""],""raw_differs"":false}"
64,3,2,talk,Minato,,"I like the idea of just knowing it's ""my day"" and not worrying.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
65,3,3,talk,George,,"I'm leaning toward B. It avoids the ""favor"" trap and the ""policing"" trap.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
66,3,3,talk,Toshio,,B is the most logical for reducing the administrative burden.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
67,3,3,talk,Victoria,,I vote for B. Stability for my morning routine is the priority.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
68,3,3,talk,Misaki,,"If we can agree on a fair fixed monthly share, B is acceptable.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
69,3,3,talk,Minato,,I'll vote for B too! It sounds the most friendly.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
70,3,4,talk,George,,I vote for B.,"{""words"":4,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
